=== prompt
Find the index (0-based) of a value in the sequence [10 20 30 40], or -1 when it is absent. Log the result for 30 and then for 99.
=== expected
2
-1
=== reference
[10 20 30 40] = xs
[30 99] = targets
0 >= t
Repeat({
  targets | Take(t) = target
  -1 >= found
  0 >= i
  Repeat({
    When({All({found | Is(-1)} {xs | Take(i) | Is(target)})} {i > found})
    Inc(i)
  } times: 4)
  found | Log
  Inc(t)
} times: 2)
